"Each card is the time in a country, with its dial (dark at night), the date and the difference with your time. Add countries with the list above, order them with the arrows and remove the ones you don’t want.\n"
"\n"
"The menu bar shows your time (📍) and, next to it, the time in the countries you mark with “In the bar” or with a click in the icon’s menu, which shows them all. Daylight saving changes (Europe, United States, Cuba, Chile, Australia and New Zealand) are worked out automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Closing the window hides it: the clocks stay in the menu bar until you choose Quit."

