msgstr "A KeePass-compatible password manager, native in C++ with FLTK and without libraries: it opens and saves .kdbx files (KDBX 4) with AES-256 or ChaCha20 and Argon2, like KeePass and KeePassXC. Groups, history, recycle bin, generator, security review, key file and automatic locking."

